dictator (2.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Service: in-memory audio capture (no temp files), live audio level signal
  * Service: warm model preload, state machine hardening, clean shutdown
  * Output: clipboard-paste mode by default with clipboard restore;
    complete US-layout map for type mode (fixes dropped punctuation)
  * Extension: redesigned overlay with live level meter and timer,
    GNOME 45 notification compatibility, service crash recovery
  * Preferences: model, output mode, max duration, overlay/notification toggles
  * New: dictator CLI for non-GNOME desktops (bind "dictator toggle" anywhere)
  * New: dictator-setup for per-user environment setup after apt install
  * Packaging: remove apt-get call from postinst (Debian Policy violation),
    pair systemd unit with D-Bus activation (Type=dbus), drop debconf question
  * Pinned Python dependencies (requirements.txt)

